Proj4Sedona

This product includes an index of coordinate system names and codes derived from the
Esri projection engine database documentation (https://github.com/Esri/projection-engine-db-doc),
Copyright Esri, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The file src/main/resources/org/datasyslab/proj4sedona/constants/esri-aliases.tsv is
generated from that repository by scripts/sync-esri-aliases.py. It carries object names
and codes only; no geodetic parameter dataset is bundled with this product.
